	TAD TARGET
	DCA WBUFFER
	TAD UNITZ
	CLL RTL 
	RTL 
	RTL 
	RAL
	TAD STARGET
	DCA WBUFFER+1
/WORDS 63 AND 64 OR 127 AND 128 ARE OUT-SUMCHECK WORDS
