	DCA XXDMP		/STORE NUMBER TO BE PRINTED
	TAD K7000
	DCA .-3			/NOP JMP ISZDIG, LEADING ZEROS WILL NOT BE PRINTED
	TAD XXDMP		/RETURN VALUE TO BE PRINTED.
	TAD (260)		/FOR ASCII COMPONENT
	TYPEIT
	ISZ CCNT		/INDICATES A CHARACTER HAS BEEN PRINTED
ISZDIG,	ISZ DIGITS		/INDEX DIGIT COUNT
	JMP SHIFT
	ISZ XCNT		/TY8OCT?
