/WHICH DETECTED A DATA NO STATUS ERROR (DNS), OR
/...ENTRY TO THIS POINT MAY HAVE BEEN FROM ROUTINES "XHUNGUP" OR "HUNGUP"
/THEREBY FORCING AN ERROR INFORMATION PRINTOUT
/
XXFORCE, 0
	ISZ BUSY
	JMP RXERROR
