/PRINT AN ERROR MESSAGE IF AC SW 4 = 0
/
LASSW4,	LAS
	AND (SW4)
	SZA CLA 
	JMP NOPRINT
/THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION IS PRINTED FOR ALL ERRORS DETECTED
/
/THE ERROR HEADER TEXT IS INHIBITED IF THE ERROR IS NOT THE FIRST ERROR EVER
/
/
/
/	FAT	CMND	XDR	CODE	RST	START	TARGET	XXXX	PASS
